Description: Screenshot capture and annotation tool
 A Linux port of Windows Greenshot (not affiliated with or endorsed by the
 Greenshot project): region, window, and full-screen capture; an annotation
 editor (shapes, text, whole-image effects); configurable global capture
 hotkeys; and autostart-on-login integration.
 .
 Automatic hotkey configuration (offered once, on first run) is
 Cinnamon-specific, using org.cinnamon.desktop.keybindings. The
 application itself runs on any GTK3 desktop environment under X11;
 on non-Cinnamon desktops, hotkeys can still be bound manually to the
 same command-line capture options this package provides.
